      "content": "breathing doesn't work. it's not just noise, it's everything. every feeling, every thought, every single thing is just... vibrating under my skin. everything is so heavy. i've tried all the relaxation stuff and it doesn't change anything. it just feels like i'm stuck in a room where the walls are closing in and it'll never, ever be quiet.",
